      "content": "Option A is clearly the superior choice for an executive role. It uses sophisticated vocabulary and maintains a highly professional tone, which is what high-level hiring managers expect. Option B is far too casual and unprofessional; it sounds like something a recent college graduate might write. Stick with Option A to present a polished and competent image.",
